1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,577
The tide is out!

2
00:00:01,677 --> 00:00:04,331
Grab everything that glitters

3
00:00:04,431 --> 00:00:05,941
A full bag slows you down

4
00:00:06,091 --> 00:00:08,894
Just one more…?

5
00:00:08,994 --> 00:00:12,041
Tide's coming. Run!

6
00:00:12,191 --> 00:00:14,841
Phew, made it!

7
00:00:15,041 --> 00:00:19,891
Build with what you bring back

8
00:00:20,091 --> 00:00:22,941
Reach places you couldn't before

9
00:00:23,041 --> 00:00:24,591
Until the empty island is a village

10
00:00:25,091 --> 00:00:27,141
Low Tide Island — One thumb. Back before the tide.
